ence": -2, "id": "39"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Ytdo46ZSq1o/maxresdefault.jpg", "height": 720, "width": 1280, "preference": -1, "id": "40", "resolution": "1280x720"}, {"url": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/Ytdo46ZSq1o/maxresdefault.webp", "height": 1080, "width": 1920, "preference": 0, "id": "41", "resolution": "1920x1080"}], "thumbnail": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/Ytdo46ZSq1o/maxresdefault.webp", "description": "This weeks video is a venture in to ASMR again but this time we're going with Ice Cream Cookie Sandwiches!\n\nWe've gone with Double Chocolate cookies and Red Velvet Cookies, they are perfect with a slight gooey centre and loaded with chocolate chips. \n\nFor the ice cream, we've gone with heavenly white chocolate ice cream with a slight boozy kick from some Mozart white chocolate liqueur ;).....you're welcome!\n\nWhat do you need?\n\nCookies:\nCookies Recipe:\n* 150g Butter , softened\n* 200g Sugar\n* 1 Egg\n* 1 tsp vanilla extract\n* 200g flour\n* 1 tsp  baking soda\n* 25g  cocoa powder (double chocolate)\n* 100g Milk Chocolate chips (double chocolate)\n* Red Food Colouring (red velvet)\n* 8g cocoa powder (red velvet)\n* White Chocolate Chips (red velvet)\n\nInstructions\n- Preheat oven to 175c/350f degrees.\n- In a large bowl, cream together butter and sugar and beat until smooth.\n- Beat in egg, then stir in the vanilla.\n- Combine flour, baking soda, and salt; stir into the creamed mixture until just blended. Divide the mix in 2 and add the 25g cocoa and milk chocolate chips to one half. Add the red food coloring, 8g of cocoa and white chocolate chips to the other half. Put them in the fridge for 2-3 hours. \n- Make 2” rounds and place on a covered cookie sheet\n- Bake for 12-15 mins\n- Cool completely\n\nFor the White Chocolate Ice Cream:\n435ml Milk\n450ml Cream @40%\n70g Sugar\n60g Dextrose\n40g Golden syrup\n35g SMP\n50g White Chocolate \n30ml Mozart White Chocolate liqueur\n\nWarm the milk, sugars & SMP slightly then add the white chocolate and stir until melted. Take off the heat, add the cream, then chill in the fridge over night. \nWhite chocolate often semi solidifies in the fridge so be prepared to get busy with an emersion blender or whisk before churning. \n\nIf you enjoyed this video, please consider liking and subscribing, plus pop over to our Instagram and Facebook pages linked below and say hello :)\n\nInstagram: https://tinyurl.com/2p85zcxh\nFacebook: http://tiny.cc/mmxosz\nWebsite: https://www.polaricecreamery.com\n\n\nThanks and see you on the next video where we go Vegan ice cream again :)\n\n#icecreamsandwiches #icecream #icecreamrecipe #gelato #cookies #perfectcookies #asmr \n\n0:00 Introduction\n1:10 Remove from heat\n1:29 Chill in fridge 4 hours\n2:22 Melt in microwave for 15 seconds\n3:36 Divide the mix in two\n5:12 Fridge for 2-3 hours\n5:37 Musso 5030 (Stella or Pola) tick tick tick tick\n5:43 Freeze for 2 hours\n6:06 Bake at 175c fan for 13-15 minutes\n6:14 Let the cookies cool for 2 hours\n6:17 Wait patiently........\n7:00 Let's try the ice cream\n7:07 VERY nice white chocolate flavour with alcohol bonus\n7:15 Melting....", "channel_id": "UCjYtWtUzbtxFLufK6bCJrxQ", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjYtWtUzbtxFLufK6bCJrxQ", "duration": 459, "view_count": 410, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ytdo46ZSq1o", "categories": ["Howto & Style"], "tags": ["asmr eating", "ice cream", "asmr", "ice cream sandwich asmr", "ice cream sandwich", "making ice cream sandwiches", "red velvet cookies", "red velvet cookie recipes", "double chocolate chip cookies", "double chocolate chip cookie recipe", "making ice cream", "white chocolate ice cream", "boozy ice cream", "mozart chocolate liqueur", "asmr eating sounds"], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {}, "subtitles": {},